  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Shows each night of a participant's wrist-worn sensor data so a researcher can correct GGIR's predicted sleep onset and offset, mark extra sleep periods, exclude nights with too much missing data, and flag nights for review, with every change saved automatically. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
